01:21:23.415 --> 01:21:26.215
Public interest signs of a temporary

01:21:26.695 --> 01:21:27.495
nature,

01:21:28.055 --> 01:21:29.255
political education,

01:21:29.255 --> 01:21:30.135
civil, religious,

01:21:32.855 --> 01:21:34.535
