01:35:11.790 --> 01:35:14.030
I'm looking at maybe

01:35:14.645 --> 01:35:21.285
thirty days per quarter and that way you could have the two quarters that go neck and neck and that gives you sixty days before the election

01:35:21.685 --> 01:35:22.645
or whatever.

01:35:23.525 --> 01:35:30.100
Or we could just eliminate it completely but I didn't think that eliminating it completely is good either

01:35:30.580 --> 01:35:35.620
because I go around and I see tree work signs that have been up for close to a year

01:35:36.180 --> 01:35:46.095
and you know they're looking kind of ratty and at some point we just ought to stop advertising for the guy that cut down your tree a year ago and giving him that advertisement.

01:35:46.095 --> 01:35:48.095
So I think we need to put something in there.

01:35:48.415 --> 01:35:51.935
I just don't know that I have the right answer in there yet when I put forty days.

01:35:55.820 --> 01:36:03.900
And I felt that it was inappropriate for, you know, at our discretion we could extend the total allowable time period by ninety days.

01:36:04.220 --> 01:36:06.780
I thought that was inconsistent

01:36:06.235 --> 01:36:09.755
with the free speech thing. That's regulating content. I thought

01:36:10.075 --> 01:36:11.035
we would be

01:36:11.355 --> 01:36:14.475
not well served to have that allowance in there.

01:36:15.515 --> 01:36:19.620
